  - the build, extraction and verification scripts in _work/ and _verify/
  - the generated index files INDEX.tsv, INDEX.json, INDEX-compact.json
    and manifest.json
  - the documentation: README.md, CLAUDE.md, shadcn.md, COVERAGE.md,
    GAPS.md, THIRD-PARTY.md, and skills/shadcn-archive/

It does not apply to the bundled material, which remains under its original
license: the component source in registry/, the documentation in docs/, the
fonts, images and other media in assets/, the shadcn skill in
skills/shadcn-ui/, and the license texts in licenses/. Some of that material
is provided under terms that restrict redistribution. See THIRD-PARTY.md for
the full list of sources, licenses and restrictions.

The index files describe the bundled material and reproduce descriptions from
it; those descriptions remain under the terms of their original sources.

